 "note": "Traced over the lidar point-cloud intensity (USGS, 2024-25), where every paved lane shows as a plain dark band under the trees, with its pull-in pads; the Census lines ran 5 to 20 m off them. Replaced all the roads: the west road and the north road with the lot link, the A loop (the hairpin past A13 to A22 joined to the loop round A02, A09 and A12) and its cross lane, the D road from the junction round the shore past D57 to D22 and down past D21 to D01 to the park road, the lane north past D48 to D52, the road south past E01 to the park road and the E loop past E03 to E11, the park road itself, the F loop round the boat-ramp lot with its inner lane, and the road east past F11. Kept the boat-ramp lot loop (it follows the open pavement on the photo) and the park road west of the A loop. Left out: the short pull-ins, the small lanes round D51 to D54 and A08 to A11."
